# Build output
#
# Only the configuration subdirectories, not `bin/` itself: a .NET project's bin/ holds nothing but
# build output, and a blanket `bin/` silently excluded bin/shopify-dev from the first commit. The
# Rails app next door keeps its scripts in bin/ for the same reason.
**/bin/Debug/
**/bin/Release/
**/bin/publish/
obj/
artifacts/
*.user
*.suo

# Tooling scratch (see AGENTS.md: DOTNET_CLI_HOME must live inside the workspace)
.dotnet/
.nuget/
tools-local/

# Local configuration and secrets
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.Local.json
.env
.env.local
*.pfx

# Test output
TestResults/
*.trx
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Python bytecode from the tooling scripts
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
